# inc-1brg A and D: what Storycraft's "Augment which item?" menu offers. Read by
# tools/check_storycraft.sh (seed 1), from the frozen orc bard
# tools/fixtures/chars/orc-bard-reapply-seed1.sav. Kept apart from
# storycraft-confirm.keys because that script's @choose aborts the whole run
# when the item is missing, which would hide the menu this one photographs.
i
@dump:inventory-before
ESC
u
@choose "Storycraft"
@dump:augment-menu
ESC
@quit
